# =============================================================================
# FINAL WARNING COMMENT
# =============================================================================
#
# ⚠️  IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTICE:
# This .gitignore file protects against accidental commits of:
# - Personal chat data (result.json, *.json)
# - Environment configurations (.env files)
# - Generated PDFs (chats_clean_pdf/)
# - Processing metadata (metadata/)
# - IDE settings (.idea/, .vscode/, .claude/)
# - AI assistant configurations and caches
# - System files and caches
#
# Always verify with 'git status' before committing!
# Never commit files containing personal information!
#
# ============================================================================= 